00:27:11,126 --> 00:27:12,326
I think we have one hand up on Zoom.

308
00:27:12,346 --> 00:27:14,647
Would anyone else in person like to speak before we go to Zoom?

309
00:27:16,592 --> 00:27:20,295
You can also speak after we go do some Zoom folks too, if you think of something to say.

310
00:27:20,676 --> 00:27:23,138
I'm gonna go to Barbara Corbett on Zoom.

311
00:27:23,218 --> 00:27:25,460
If you could just share your name and address of the record, please.

